ness Creatine Gummies?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f71b428f-e5e9-4546-ab39-b596f69b21d1" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-yio9nl"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-1fpou9k" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R2dj2:" aria-controls="replo-:R2dj2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="d95beaea-730c-4474-b070-78547accea3b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-hg7xl9"><div data-rid="944fba9c-f286-4858-8d85-0075d331a025" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-2zest6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>For optimal results, we recommend taking 2-3 gummies daily. You can take them any time of day, but many users prefer taking them before or after their workout. Consistency is key with creatine supplementation, so try to take them at the same time each day. There's no need for a loading phase with our gummies, but you may increase the dosage for more intense training periods if desired.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="384d445a-7f9a-4b84-98e5-f3bcb52126b3" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1vm3vvd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="db19cd18-f842-4685-99cc-74aa3d584dc7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R3dj2:" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1u9hu6x"><div data-rid="9b955040-5e3d-4830-92de-52451f85d264" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" class="r-11c6e9j alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>How do you ensure the quality of your creatine?</p></span></div><div data-rid="6ab5ca35-7d67-4660-90d4-1d1acc5f3998" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0.0.0" c